1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,140
This Procurement workflow starts with
a material requirement from Sales.

2
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:10,740
We will create the linked supplier order,
review its details, and issue it for

3
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:11,940
the Incoming Goods team.

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,220
Step one: Review the Material Requirements.

5
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:21,440
Open Purchasing, then Pending Material Requirements.

6
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:27,640
Select the demand to buy and check the
required quantity and its originating Sales

7
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:28,180
Order.

8
00:00:30,833 --> 00:00:33,413
Step two: Create the Purchase Order.

9
00:00:33,913 --> 00:00:36,693
Choose Create Purchase Order from the Procurement tab.

10
00:00:37,393 --> 00:00:41,813
Review the selected requirements and whether
identical articles should be merged.

11
00:00:44,542 --> 00:00:46,922
Create the order and inspect the result.

12
00:00:47,502 --> 00:00:53,262
This example created one Purchase Order with
one line covering the selected requirement.

13
00:00:54,082 --> 00:00:57,762
Check any skipped rows or warnings before continuing.

14
00:01:00,375 --> 00:01:03,075
Step three: Review the supplier order.

15
00:01:03,675 --> 00:01:09,355
Open the new Purchase Order and check the
vendor, ordering company, currency, delivery and

16
00:01:09,375 --> 00:01:11,895
invoice addresses, and purchasing instructions.

17
00:01:14,875 --> 00:01:16,195
Review the order lines.

18
00:01:16,855 --> 00:01:20,315
The supplier price is separate from the customer selling price.

19
00:01:20,995 --> 00:01:26,795
Here, four pieces cost fifteen euros
and forty cents each, for a total of

20
00:01:26,815 --> 00:01:29,135
sixty-one euros and sixty cents.

21
00:01:31,833 --> 00:01:34,313
Step four: Issue the Purchase Order.

22
00:01:35,013 --> 00:01:36,333
Select its header in Explorer.

23
00:01:37,073 --> 00:01:40,273
Choose Change State, select Issued, and apply.

24
00:01:41,273 --> 00:01:45,233
Vendor portal sharing and sending the
order are separate purchasing steps.

25
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,260
Verify that the transition succeeded.

26
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:56,140
Give Incoming Goods the supplier order
reference and agreed delivery information.

27
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,840
Issuing an order does not receive stock.

28
00:02:01,458 --> 00:02:04,078
Pause for details and follow the full guide.
